"""Leading with AI (Leadership Edition), Session 8: Making AI know your business: assistants on your own documents.  Written 12 November 2026.

Pattern (from the approved pilots, Sessions 0 and 2): recall and a hook with a real case; the idea as a ladder of pictures with no maths;
the six-industry tour and three case stories; a recorded demonstration; your people; questions to ask; the portfolio hands-on; the decision;
the take-away.

Cases (research/*.md): GAP-01 Telstra (hook and tour), BNK-12 Morgan Stanley (case), AGR-11 Kisan e-Mitra (case), GAP-02 McKinsey Lilli (case and
people), GAP-05 Standard Bank (tour), LGL-05 Allen & Overy Harvey (people), BNK-14 Bank of America Erica (people), ENR-05 Octopus Energy (people).
Added from the case bank for the tour: AGR-04 Digital Green Farmer.Chat (agriculture tile, Kenya), HLT-01 Penda Health (health tile, Kenya),
GAP-08 ULII (public-sector tile, Uganda).  Nile Valley Foods is FICTIONAL and fills the manufacturing tile as today's demonstration.
Demonstration: recorded runs in demo_runs/s09/ (copied from the Executive Edition): retrieval (sentence-transformers 6.2.0, all-MiniLM-L6-v2,
6 Nov 2026), chunking comparison (6 Nov 2026), LoRA on GPT-2 (6 Nov 2026), and the assistant runs: no handbook (A run 1 and 2), three retrieved
clauses (B run 1 and 2), Claude fresh sessions 6 Nov 2026; whole handbook (Case Runs F2b run 1 and 2, 4 Nov 2026).  Scored in demo_runs/s10_scoring.md.
"""

